    "designDecisionSummary": "Vercel Design Library dark theme (#0a0a0a bg, #fafafa fg, #282828 border, Geist/Geist Mono fonts, 8px radius, single blue accent #3a81f6 = --chart-2). Premium dark landing page for the local-first AI persona system. Typographic hero with animated voice-waveform orb, bento capability grid (varied spans, not 3-equal), voice-clone spotlight panel, local-first privacy band, 3-step flow, CTA, real footer. Monochrome surfaces with borders + single blue accent; subtle glows via color-mix on tokens; scroll-reveal + waveform micro-interactions; prefers-reduced-motion respected. Buttons/cards/nav follow Vercel component anatomy (primary/ghost button, card with eyebrow/title/value/meta, topbar nav with brand+links+meta). All colors via var(--token); radius via library --radius and bridge aliases.",
